    "detailed_description": "<strong>The Renovator: Origins</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game.<br>Explore the mysterious world of art, where each exhibit contains the mysteries and secrets of its era and its creator. The game will immerse you in the past and another world that is behind the paintings.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1917550/extras/40b29a563e27d33c708c8986f524404c.avif?t=1752171490\" /></div><br>You play as the son of a restorer, a museum worker who died tragically. While searching for the memorabilia, the door suddenly closes and strange things begin to happen. The hero is waiting for immersion in the world of art and the paranormal.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1917550/extras/2d5a2d361072bd7b84484bb4102c1a24.poster.avif?t=1752171490\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1917550/extras/2d5a2d361072bd7b84484bb4102c1a24.webm?t=1752171490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1917550/extras/2d5a2d361072bd7b84484bb4102c1a24.mp4?t=1752171490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1917550/extras/75818f42e8aec97ea789a09772285612.avif?t=1752171490\" /></div><br>Hidden Objects, Solving Puzzles and Investigating the Mystery of Father's Death.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1917550/extras/2144b8040628c2dcc3cf4764a0a6c713.poster.avif?t=1752171490\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1917550/ext